  "html": "<table cellpadding=\"5\" style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left; max-width: 300px;\">\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#CC0033; color:#FFFFFF;\"> Sons Of Tubgirl &lt;Sons Of Tubgirl&gt;\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"2\"> <a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/GUILD-Sons_of_tubgirl_Rock_me.gif\" title=\"Image:GUILD-Sons_of_tubgirl_Rock_me.gif\"><img alt=\"Image:GUILD-Sons_of_tubgirl_Rock_me.gif\" border=\"0\" height=\"203\" src=\"/images/GUILD-Sons_of_tubgirl_Rock_me.gif\" width=\"270\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#FF3333;\"> Leader\n</th><td> <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/User/Joej989\" title=\"User:Joej989\">Shanks McFisty</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#FF3333;\"> No. of members\n</th><td> 7\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#FF3333;\"> VoIP\n</th><td> No\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#FF3333;\"> Language\n</th><td> no habla noob\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#FF3333;\"> IRC channel\n</th><td> N/A\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#FF3333;\"> Forums\n</th><td> N/A\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#FF3333;\"> Time zone\n</th><td> E.S.T.\n</td></tr></table>\n<a name=\"Guild_Overview\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Guild Overview </span></h2>\n<a name=\"Latest_News\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Latest News </span></h2>\n<p>It all began one fall afternoon, whilst remembering our roots, we came to see the light.. And it was TubGirl, our matron saint. And from that sprang the mighty posse that would one day crush noobdom, and they are now known as <b>The Sons of TubGirl</b>...insert echoing sound here.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Members\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Members </span></h2